{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bearstone Campsite is a first-person horror game that tells the story of someone lost in the depths of the forest while trying to have fun with friends, and their struggle to survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maria, Paul, and Nathan shouldn't have gone without you. Going there without the only smart person... was a big mistake. Now they're gone. Your phone has no signal, night is falling, and the campsite holds something beyond silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this version, explore the camp's surroundings, collect the clues left behind, and try to find out what happened to your friends. But be careful, you're not alone in the forest. Something is watching you in the night, breathing down your neck. And with every step you take, they get a little closer.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3799220?t=1760372578","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799220/81f7503ceb44e2c60e3107fdb8419603be40df93/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760372578","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799220/4a88f632f8798ecc482d08f225d2cd0dd9210527/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760372578","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799220/4a88f632f8798ecc482d08f225d2cd0dd9210527/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760372578","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"HDR available","id":61}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bearstone Campsite is a first-person horror game that tells the story of someone lost in the depths of the forest while trying to have fun with friends, and their 